KRYON — Third-party data attribution
=====================================

This file lists data sources bundled with KRYON that require
attribution under their respective licenses. Software dependencies
declared in pyproject.toml carry their own license terms and are not
duplicated here.

---------------------------------------------------------------------
CISA ICS Advisory Project
---------------------------------------------------------------------

The file at:

    src/kryon/knowledge/datasets/cisa_ics_advisories_seed.csv

contains a current-year subset of the CISA ICS Advisory Project,
made available by the project maintainers under the
Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0.

  Source repository: https://github.com/icsadvprj/ICS-Advisory-Project
  License:           Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0
                     http://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1.0/
  Database contents: Database Contents License (DbCL) v1.0
                     http://opendatacommons.org/licenses/dbcl/1.0/

When redistributing KRYON or any work derived from this dataset, you
MUST keep this NOTICE intact and preserve the attribution string:

    "Contains information from the ICS Advisory Project, licensed
     under the Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0."

Operators who refresh the dataset via
`scripts/update_cisa_advisories.sh` pull the full Master CSV into
$KRYON_HOME/datasets/ — the same attribution rules apply to that
copy.
